Once upon a time, News <chrisD2@yahoo.com> said:
>Have someone succeed in configuring these modules on TRU 64 5.1B for auth 
>ldap using ?

Since Tru64 doesn't use PAM, pam_ldap won't work.  Tru64 also doesn't
use a Solaris/Linux style NSS, so I would expect nss_ldap would take a
lot of work to port to Tru64.

Tru64 has its own LDAP support available as part of the Internet Express
package (see http://h30097.www3.hp.com/internet/osis.htm).
